codex
The first finalized anchors show occupancy RULE decisions of 1.742 s and 1.765 s, both well within the unchanged 10 s budget, and occupancy activation fired on both. Their UNILATERAL convergence took about 231 s each; those times are reported separately and do not affect deployability classification.
